<BlogLayout title="Cold Calling in 2026: What's Changed and What Still Works" description="A comprehensive analysis of modern cold calling strategies that respect prospects while driving real results." date="2026-02-08" author="Sali Koule" authorInitials="SK" readTime="10 min read">
  <style>
    .timeline-container {
      margin: 3rem 0;
    }

    .timeline-item {
